WEBVTT

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:10.880
You're wearing your usual
dress today, I see.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.430
What a pity. You looked so lovely
in that gown yesterday!

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:17.390
Thanks, but I couldn't wear
a corset like that every day...

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:20.810
Really? Do you find it difficult?

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:23.310
It's not difficult, just... painful?

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:25.020
Black hair...

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.610
Aira!

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:29.190
There you are. Come.

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:31.820
Coming.

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:21.780
Sorry, gonna be late tonight!
Can you grab dinner by yourself?

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:28.650
Sorry, gonna be late tonight!
Can you grab dinner by yourself?

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:28.650
Yep. I'll pick something up
from the convenience store.

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:30.120
Sorry, gonna be late tonight!
Can you grab dinner by yourself?

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:30.120
Yep. I'll pick something up
from the convenience store.

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:30.120
Stay safe!
Don't forget to lock the door!

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:35.360
I'll be back.

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:47.700
Interlude

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:53.250
T'would seem you've
regained your composure.

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:58.720
I am Kyle Salutania, crown prince
of the Kingdom of Salutania.

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:01.260
May I ask your name?

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:06.010
Misono Aira.

00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:07.680
Oh, Aira is my given name.

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:14.310
Um, how did I get here?

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:18.900
We summoned you here using
the Saint Summoning Ritual.

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:21.070
What's that?

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:21.720
Damian.

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:22.490
Yes.

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:29.330
Our Kingdom faces unprecedented danger.

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:32.120
Terrible monsters, birthed by
a dark miasma, ravage the land...

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:35.340
Monsters? Miasma?

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:37.710
What's a "miasma"?

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:42.970
I don't get it.
I don't understand what he's saying.

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:46.390
Am I in a dream, or some kind of manga?

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:49.930
However, no Saint has appeared in our age,

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:54.270
so following with tradition, we decided
to use a ritual devised by ancient mages

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:56.840
No, it's all really happening.

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:57.770
to summon a woman with
the necessary qualities.

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:59.030
As such!

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:04.450
As the future king, it is my duty
to address this crisis we face!

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:07.030
And so, I called for the Saint Summoning
Ritual to be carried out at once!

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:08.660
If...

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:09.950
Yes?

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:14.370
If I kill all the monsters,
can I go back home?

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:22.260
I've never read any accounts of
the Saint returning to her world.

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:24.760
So I can't go home?

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:47.030
How is Aira?

00:04:47.030 --> 00:04:50.490
She seems to have cried herself to sleep.

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:51.500
I see.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.630
Damian.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:58.710
Your Highness?

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:02.880
When your father passes, you will
become the next Prime Minister.

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:06.470
When you do, would you die for your king?

00:05:06.470 --> 00:05:08.300
If he so commanded, then yes.

00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:11.310
I thought as much. I would do the same.

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:14.020
That is our lot in life.

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:16.400
And none other's.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:18.560
But never mind that.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:23.190
I've signed the necessary documents.
I leave the rest to you.

00:05:23.190 --> 00:05:24.400
It will be done.

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:31.410
Lady Aira, what gown would
you like to wear today?

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:39.840
Lady Aira?

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:40.960
Yes?

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:42.750
Might I suggest this one?

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:46.550
Yes, it looks beautiful.

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:57.020
I think this cutesy one
will look best on you, Aira.

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:58.600
Oh, you look so adorable!

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:03.780
Yep, that's the one!

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:07.990
You look wonderful, honey.

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:10.740
Thanks!

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:15.660
You look wonderful.

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:21.210
I knew that color would suit you best.

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:23.170
Thank you very much.

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:25.170
Is there anything you
find yourself still lacking?

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:27.220
No, not particularly.

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:31.260
I have a room, and clothes,
and I'm being fed well.

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:34.100
Everyone's been so kind to me, too.

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:37.100
As they should be.
You <i>are </i>the Saint, after all.

00:06:39.230 --> 00:06:41.810
About that...

00:06:41.810 --> 00:06:44.650
This still doesn't seem real to me yet.

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:45.780
It doesn't?

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:51.660
Huh? I...

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:41.370
--Read 'em and weep!
--Damn it all!

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:44.290
--I'll be takin' that coin of--
--Guys, get back to your posts!

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:46.340
Prince Kyle is making his rounds!

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:47.500
Crap, really?!

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:52.800
Good work, men.

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:01.600
All right, back to work.

00:08:04.440 --> 00:08:07.270
Do people not like him?

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:17.280
What do you think of Salutania?

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:22.210
I think it's a beautiful, lively kingdom,
Your Highness.

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:25.710
Sometimes <i>too </i>lively, which can
be somewhat troublesome.

00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:35.590
Part of our duties is ensuring
adherence to proper social discipline.

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:39.060
Adhere... what?

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:46.020
In simpler terms, we must be
strict with the Kingdom's people

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:48.440
to help uphold the Kingdom's peace.

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:52.440
Though this manner of conduct
does not endear us to said people.

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:54.150
I-I see.

00:08:55.910 --> 00:08:59.080
Yet His Royal Highness endures it.

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:10.590
I think it's a wonderful kingdom.

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:14.550
I do hope you come to like it.

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:16.470
I'm... sure I will.

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:23.770
When all this is over, I will search
for a way to return you home.

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:26.230
However, I cannot promise you
that I will succeed.

00:09:28.770 --> 00:09:30.980
I beg of you,

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:34.150
please lend us your power.

00:09:34.150 --> 00:09:37.780
I want to keep our Kingdom safe.
I must see to it that it is protected!

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:41.080
O-Oh, no, you don't have to--

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:46.870
I get it now.

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:51.460
He's extremely self-centered and awkward,

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:54.170
and direct to a fault.

00:09:57.010 --> 00:09:58.590
Um, Prince Kyle?

00:10:01.310 --> 00:10:06.270
I don't know what it means
to <i>be </i>the Saint,

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:09.060
but I'll do what I must.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.200
A-And I'll do my best!

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:54.900
--Incredible!
--Excellent work.

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:11.290
T'would seem your studies are going well.

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:14.800
Really? I can't really tell if they <i>are</i>.

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:18.010
But I'm having so much fun learning magic!

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:21.470
I'm glad to hear that.

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:23.970
We intend to have you assist
on monster-killing expeditions.

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:27.470
I'd be going with them?

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:37.280
You need not worry. You will be joined
by myself, Damian, and the others.

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:38.740
We will keep you safe.

00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:42.870
Does that ease your worries?

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:47.870
I'm not sure.
I don't know if I'm scared, or...

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:51.750
But...

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:56.000
I will if I must. That's why I was
Summoned here, right?

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:06.850
You will be a most incredible Saint.

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:10.520
I will prove it to them, one and all.

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:14.520
Please, help me to save
this Kingdom from destruction.

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:15.980
I-I'll do my best!

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:34.920
We've warned you a dozen times, yet
you still insist on behaving like this?

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:38.550
Prince Kyle has a fiancée.

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:43.340
Do you understand what you're doing
to her by constantly being around him?

00:12:43.340 --> 00:12:46.140
And the other boys, too. Do you even--

00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:47.510
Hey!

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:49.350
What are you doing with her?

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:50.930
Prince Kyle!

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:52.810
Come, Aira.

00:12:52.810 --> 00:12:53.940
Coming!

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:50.370
I--

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:50.370
Good day!

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:53.250
Oh? Waiting out the rain?

00:13:53.250 --> 00:13:56.710
Yes, I'm ashamed to admit
I've forgotten my umbrella.

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:58.920
You may join us under ours if you'd like.

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:01.130
No, I couldn't impose.

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:03.260
Please, I do insist.

00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:06.380
No, no, really, I couldn't.

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:08.840
Too late, you're already here!

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:12.430
Come now, shall we?

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:13.720
Yes, let's.

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:18.150
How lucky for you that we were passing by!

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:19.480
Lucky indeed!

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:22.360
Oh, how did you fare on the exam today?

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:25.490
Not very well, I'm afraid...

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:37.870
Lady Aira!

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:43.380
My word!

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:49.680
Don't worry. It's just water.

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:19.540
See? All better.

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:30.090
Oh, forgive me! I've never seen someone
wield magic in such a precise manner.

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:34.140
Incredible. You truly are completely dry.

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:38.890
Oh, well, I'm not <i>completely </i>dry.

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:43.810
I, uh, didn't want my hair
or skin getting <i>too </i>dry,

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:48.400
so I left a little bit of moisture
there to, uh, help...

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:10.050
This report is so astounding that its
contents seem no more than falsehoods.

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:14.300
Especially the statement that her
holy-affinity magic has healed lost limbs.

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:16.810
That's not all.

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:22.640
The houses of Count Valdec,
Margrave Hawke, and Marquis Drewes...

00:16:22.640 --> 00:16:27.070
All of those powerful houses have
stepped in to provide her patronage.

00:16:30.070 --> 00:16:32.910
I turned my back on her because
of her dull appearance!

00:16:32.910 --> 00:16:35.120
She looked to be no more than a servant,
or a wet-nurse!

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:38.160
Why would the Crown Prince address
a woman so clearly beneath him?!

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:40.000
Your Highness, forgive me my words,

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:42.750
but it would do you well to understand
the trappings of otherworldly cultures.

00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:44.420
I <i>know </i>that!

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:48.550
It was mistake born of
my own stubborn pride.

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:52.840
But admitting that now could trigger
another quarrel over my succession.

00:16:54.430 --> 00:17:00.430
The Second Prince would likely approach
those aforementioned noble houses.

00:17:00.430 --> 00:17:04.060
Most importantly, what would happen
to Aira if she were <i>not </i>the Saint?

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:07.730
Even if she is not the Saint,

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:12.820
as she <i>is </i>from another world, the Kingdom
will find some other use for her.

00:17:12.820 --> 00:17:16.280
Which means living her life
as a captive in the Palace.

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:20.740
Would Aira want such a thing?

00:17:20.740 --> 00:17:23.000
Your Highness, with all due respect,

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:25.120
I do not think she has
a place in high society...

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:29.750
That question was meant for myself.
I know the answer.

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:32.920
Aira had a place, a home,
and I took that from her.

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:36.800
As such, I must find her
a new place to call home.

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:38.720
That is my duty as the future King.

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:42.180
What do you plan to do, then?

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:43.770
Nothing, for now.

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:46.650
I will continue on as planned
until I can no longer.

00:17:46.650 --> 00:17:51.190
I will play the role of incompetent,
stubborn crown prince.

00:17:51.190 --> 00:17:54.530
After witnessing my arbitrary,
reckless behavior involving her,

00:17:54.530 --> 00:17:57.360
the court will take pity on her.

00:17:57.360 --> 00:17:59.320
I see.

00:17:59.320 --> 00:18:00.990
Though it will cause you much trouble.

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:07.250
Handling that trouble is my duty
as your future Prime Minister.

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:16.680
May I have a moment of your time?

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:19.970
I don't believe we've spoken before.

00:18:19.970 --> 00:18:25.100
I am Elizabeth Ashley,
fiancée to Prince Kyle.

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:30.860
As I'm sure many other young
ladies have already warned you,

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:35.400
it does not reflect favorably upon you
to be so close to a man with a fianceé.

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:38.280
If...

00:18:40.410 --> 00:18:45.040
If it would be all right with you,
might I join you?

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:46.160
Huh?

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:47.290
What are you doing to her?

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:50.920
Your Highness!

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:56.590
Elizabeth, what business
do you have with Aira?

00:18:56.590 --> 00:18:59.680
I only wished to speak
with her for but a moment.

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:01.050
That's all?

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:06.350
Yes. Since Lady Aira always studies with
you and your friends after classes,

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:09.940
I thought I might offer her my assistance
with her studies as well.

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:14.820
That won't be necessary.

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:17.110
I will look after Aira.

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:25.660
Was that all?

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:29.040
Oh, there you are.

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:30.790
I've been looking for you, Brother.

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:36.630
Good day to you, Prince Rayne.

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:39.050
What is it?

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:44.430
The Professor wishes to speak to you
about next week's expedition.

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:46.640
Very well. Come, Aira.

00:19:58.530 --> 00:20:00.070
Talk about bad timing.

00:20:02.240 --> 00:20:07.830
I only wished to help her,
but he simply refuses to listen.

00:20:07.830 --> 00:20:12.920
That seems to be the case for anything
that happens to concern Lady Aira.

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:18.880
I've heard rumors that the other woman
who was Summoned is the true Saint.

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:24.300
How will everyone react, then, when only
one woman is being put upon a pedestal?

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:28.180
I even asked Sei for her thoughts,
to no avail...

00:20:28.180 --> 00:20:31.230
You've met this other woman, Liz?

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:33.400
I have!

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:36.060
We've become fast friends
over the past months.

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:42.450
I'd like to befriend Lady Aira
one day, too.

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:56.540
If it would be all right with you...

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:04.680
If she'd been able to finish talking,
maybe we could've been friends.

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:09.890
Next time I see her, I'll say hi.

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:15.980
Even if I can't do it right,
even if I'm awkward,

00:21:15.980 --> 00:21:16.980
I can be direct.

00:22:52.660 --> 00:22:55.120
I hear you've grown quite skilled
at manipulating magic power.

00:22:55.120 --> 00:22:56.460
Is that right, Damian?

00:22:56.460 --> 00:22:59.500
Yes, I've never seen anyone with
quite as much control as you.

00:22:59.500 --> 00:23:02.960
...so I made them in secret
so he wouldn't find out,

00:23:02.960 --> 00:23:05.210
but sure enough, he did, and this time,
he really blew up at me!

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:09.930
So now I've got a bunch. I'll give
you some next time I see you.

00:23:09.930 --> 00:23:11.350
My, are you quite sure?

00:23:11.350 --> 00:23:14.060
Of course! I'm really proud of them,
so I'm excited for you to try them!

00:23:14.060 --> 00:23:16.770
I can hardly wait!

00:23:16.770 --> 00:23:18.890
I wonder how they'll turn out today...

00:23:22.610 --> 00:23:23.610
Aira!

00:23:27.990 --> 00:23:28.990
Coming!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Next Time

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Awakening
